    "abstract": [
      {
        "source": "grobid_tei",
        "value": "We present a new OT-based two-party multiplication protocol that is almost as efficient as Gilboa's semi-honest protocol (Crypto '99), but has a high-level of security against malicious adversaries without further compilation. The achieved security suffices for many applications, and, assuming DDH, can be cheaply compiled into full security."
      },
      {
        "source": "pdfplumber",
